Leading the development and continuous improvement of SAP SuccessFactors reporting solutions, with a strong focus on Story Reporting;
Acting as a key reporting partner for business stakeholders, translating analytical needs into effective reports, dashboards, and stories;
Designing business-focused reporting solutions across SuccessFactors modules, ensuring relevant and accessible insights;
Evaluating existing reporting environments and supporting the transition from legacy tools such as Ad Hoc, Canvas, Table Reports, and ORD to Story Reporting.




You Will Need

3+ years of professional experience as an SAP SuccessFactors Reporting Specialist or in a comparable reporting and analytics role;
Strong hands-on experience with SuccessFactors Story Reporting, including the development of complex reports, dashboards, and analytical solutions;
Familiarity with SuccessFactors HR processes across areas such as Employee Central, Compensation, Learning, Recruiting, Performance, Goals, and Succession Planning;
Fluency in English;
CPLP nationality or an EU work permit is required to facilitate employment.




Would Be Awesome If You Have

BSc or MSc in Computer Science/Engineering, Information Technology, or related fields;
Exposure to modern analytics technologies such as SAP Business Data Cloud, SAP Analytics Cloud, or similar platforms;
German language skills.




What we offer:

Health-focused partnerships, including free mental health support;
25 days of vacation, including your birthday, Carnival, and a bridging day between Christmas and New Year;
